
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Basemap tiles (client build-time variable — belongs in client/.env)
#
# Without a key the map falls back to plain OpenStreetMap tiles, which need no
# account but have no dark style (App.css darkens them with a CSS filter).
# With a Stadia Maps key both light and dark get their proper style.
# Sign up at https://client.stadiamaps.com/signup/ and paste the key here.
#
# Stadia's Free plan (200,000 tiles/month) is non-commercial only. They count
# use as commercial if the service is sold or generates revenue, or if the
# operator is a for-profit organisation. A free, ad-free service run by a
# nonprofit looks like it qualifies — but confirm with support@stadiamaps.com
# in writing before launch; they handle this case by case.
#
# Attribution is a licence condition. MapView.js already renders the three
# credits Stadia require; do not trim them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REACT_APP_MAP_TILES_KEY=
